Warning [L0151] (dead_end_state): `CheckedIn` (in `state Reservation`) has no outgoing transition.
  --> tests/ui_lint/typestate_dead_end.jet:5:41
    |
  5 | state Reservation { Pending, Confirmed, CheckedIn }
    |                                         ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Typestate (D-STATE-DECL): a state with no `#Transition(CheckedIn, …)` is a dead end — a value that reaches it can never advance further.
 Fix: Add `#Transition(CheckedIn, NextState) fn …`, or remove `CheckedIn` from the declaration.
